WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You've seen a claim that twelve minutes of audio
can equal an hour of meditation. What does that mean?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Binaural beats are real auditory experiences.
A sound and a measured benefit are not the same thing.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A review of fourteen studies found conflicting results
on brainwave entrainment.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Some lab conditions helped attention,
but did not prevent vigilance decline.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells a twelve-minute routine.
The studies did not test that exact product.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free Focus Fieldbook first.
Ask for proof before you buy.
